.TH MYWM 1 "November 2026" "mywm 0.1.0-m1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mywm \- minimal student coding window manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mywm
.RB [ \-v | \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mywm
is a small X11 window manager intended for keyboard-driven student coding
sessions. It owns windows and leaves bars, launchers, terminals, editors,
notification daemons, and compositors as external tools.
.PP
This release implements M0 and M1: WM role acquisition, EWMH identity and
client lists, client lifecycle, borders, focus history, sloppy focus, safe
close, drag move/resize, master-stack and monocle layouts, gaps, and nine tags
with per-tag layout memory. Fullscreen, window rules, RandR monitors, IPC,
scratchpad, and PiP are not implemented yet. See the project README and
TODO.md for the current state.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH KEYBINDINGS
.TP
.B Super+Return
Spawn the configured terminal.
.TP
.B Super+e
Spawn the configured editor.
.TP
.B Super+b
Spawn the configured browser.
.TP
.B Super+d
Spawn the configured launcher.
.TP
.B Super+q
Close the focused window. A client that supports
.B WM_DELETE_WINDOW
is asked to close first; a second request terminates it. Clients that do not
advertise the protocol are terminated immediately.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+q
Quit the window manager without killing clients.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+r
Restart the window manager in place.
.TP
.B Super+Tab
Toggle between the current and previous tag sets.
.TP
.B Super+1 ... Super+9
View the corresponding tag.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+1 ... Super+Shift+9
Move the focused window to the corresponding tag.
.TP
.B Super+Ctrl+1 ... Super+Ctrl+9
Toggle the corresponding tag alongside the current set.
.TP
.B Super+h, Super+j, Super+k, Super+l
Focus the nearest visible client to the left, below, above, or right.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+h, Super+Shift+j, Super+Shift+k, Super+Shift+l
Swap the focused client with the nearest client in that direction.
.TP
.B Super+Ctrl+h / Super+Ctrl+l
Shrink or grow the master area.
.TP
.B Super+Space
Cycle the current tag's layout between master-stack and monocle.
.TP
.B Super+Shift+Space
Toggle the focused window between tiled and floating.
.TP
.B Super+left-drag
Move a floating window. Dragging a tiled window makes it floating first.
.TP
.B Super+right-drag
Resize a floating window.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/mywm/autostart
Shell script executed after the WM starts. It is run through
.IR /bin/sh .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DISPLAY
The X display to manage.
.TP
.B XDG_RUNTIME_DIR
Used by
.B mywmctl
to locate the control socket once the IPC server is implemented.
.SH TESTING
.B make test
starts
.BR Xephyr (1),
checks EWMH startup state, and optionally drives keybindings through XTEST
when python-xlib is available.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mywmctl (1),
.BR Xephyr (1),
.BR xterm (1)
.SH BUGS
There is no IPC server, fullscreen support, window rules, or multi-monitor
support yet. Report issues with the project's issue tracker when one is
available.
